+# Corpus fetching
+
+## Per-domain rate limit
+
+The repository records that fetching was rate-limited, but it does not record the
+limit that was actually encountered: the number of visits allowed per window, the
+window length, and the cooldown after a breach could not be found. These values
+must not be inferred from a provider's current published limits.
+
+## File-fetch hosts
+
+- `raw.githubusercontent.com` — the only file-fetch host recorded by the corpus
+  metadata (`manifest.tsv`).
+
+No additional CDN or mirror host used to fetch corpus files could be found in the
+repository. `grep.app` is recorded as the code-search source used to discover the
+files, not as a host from which the files were fetched.
